# Model × Dataset · the solution leaderboard as ONE pivot over every task result (solution × split × task). CONTRACT
# §57's `pivot:` keys; the views are data-ui dbc89e48 gallery/examples/models-datasets-tta/views.base, Zach's ruling of 2026-11-24
# ~21:30: Leaderboard (the DEFAULT), Pivot (the bare stock pivot, nested rows, with the column roll-up), the
# plain Rows, and §58's charts over the same row model: Ranks and the Bars presets. A dataset cell is the median of its tasks (the ruler's objective), a folded row the median of the rows under
# it, a deployment the equal-weight mean of its datasets; dev and holdout are never pooled. Ablation-tagged solutions are
# never ranked: the Leaderboard leaves them out; the Pivot, which ranks nothing (`color: none`, no sort), draws them.
# GENERATED by tools/build_dropins.py from the scorecards and meta.json: change the build, never this file.
# Check it: node <data-ui>/bin/data-ui.mjs check models-datasets.base
data: models-datasets.csv
noun: [task result, task results]
facets:
  - { property: ruler, label: "Ruler (columns)" }
  - { property: dataset, label: "Dataset (columns)" }
  - { property: split, label: "Split (columns)" }
  - { property: speed, label: "Speed fraction (columns)", sort: alpha }
  - { property: kind, label: "Task kind (columns)" }
  - family
  - { property: model, parent: family, searchable: true, limit: 8 }
  - { property: admissible, as: toggle, value: true, text: "Admissible solutions only" }
properties:
  family: { displayName: Family }
  model: { displayName: Model }
  config: { displayName: Config }
  solution: { displayName: Solution }
  parent: { displayName: Parent }
  change: { displayName: Change }
  ablation: { displayName: Ablation }
  admissible: { displayName: "Admissible (every gate, every task)" }
  ruler: { displayName: Ruler }
  source: { displayName: Source }
  deployment: { displayName: "Deployment · split" }
  speed: { displayName: Speed fraction }
  dataset: { displayName: Dataset }
  split: { displayName: Split }
  kind: { displayName: Task kind }
  task: { displayName: Task }
  variant: { displayName: Variant }
  full_mm: { displayName: Full-trajectory RMS }
  rms_mm: { displayName: Tool tracking RMS }
  max_mm: { displayName: Tool tracking max }
  stop_mm: { displayName: Stop error }
  sat_pct: { displayName: Saturation share }
  gates: { displayName: "Gates passed (of 5)" }
  gates_failed: { displayName: Gates failed }
  opens: { displayName: Opens }
views:
  - type: pivot
    name: Leaderboard
    filters: "ablation == false"
    splitBy: [deployment, speed, dataset, kind, task]
    value: { property: rms_mm, summary: Median }
    pivot:
      rows: [family, model, config]
      roles: { deployment: deployment, speed: group, dataset: dataset }
      rollup: median
      metrics: [rms_mm, full_mm, max_mm, stop_mm, gates]
      color: rank
      interval: median
      reference: ablation
      layout: compact
      fold: { rows: closed, columns: closed }
      sort: { column: "@ur5e_alone · dev" }
      media: { image: preview }
      headers: vertical
  - type: pivot
    name: Pivot
    splitBy: [deployment, speed, dataset, kind, task]
    value: { property: rms_mm, summary: Median }
    pivot:
      rows: [family, model, config]
      roles: { deployment: deployment, speed: group, dataset: dataset }
      rollup: median
      metrics: [rms_mm, full_mm, max_mm, stop_mm, gates]
      color: none
      reference: ablation
      layout: compact
      fold: { rows: open, columns: open }
      headers: horizontal
  - type: table
    name: Rows
    order: [model, config, solution, ruler, deployment, speed, dataset, kind, task, rms_mm, full_mm, max_mm, stop_mm, gates, gates_failed, admissible, ablation, change]
    groupBy: { property: family }
    fold: open
  # ---- THE CHARTS (lane CHARTS, 2026-11-25; Zach's ruling 2026-11-24 ~21:30): Ranks and the configurable Bars over the
  # same §57 row model (each view's `pivot:` block), and Bars presets that set every option at once. Ablations are never
  # ranked: the Ranks view keeps them in its rows and lists them as never ranked. Part of the charts' acceptance ruler
  # (tests/unit/mxd-charts.test.mjs, tests/browser/mxd_charts_checks.py, tests/fixtures/mxd-charts/): builders do not
  # edit these views.
  - type: ranks
    name: Ranks
    splitBy: [deployment, speed, dataset, kind, task]
    value: { property: rms_mm }
    pivot:
      rows: [family, model, config]
      roles: { deployment: deployment, speed: group, dataset: dataset }
      rollup: median
      metrics: [rms_mm, full_mm, max_mm, stop_mm, gates]
      reference: ablation
    ranks: { column: "@ur5e_alone · dev", blocks: task, level: config, alpha: 0.05 }
  - type: bars
    name: Bars
    filters: 'ablation == false && deployment == "ur5e_alone · dev"'
    splitBy: [deployment, speed, dataset, kind, task]
    value: { property: rms_mm }
    pivot:
      rows: [family, model, config]
      roles: { deployment: deployment, speed: group, dataset: dataset }
      rollup: median
      metrics: [rms_mm, full_mm, max_mm, stop_mm, gates]
      reference: ablation
    bars: { x: kind, color: model, orient: vertical, order: rung, scale: linear, mark: bar, interval: true, normalize: none }
  - type: bars
    name: Intervals · one task kind
    filters: 'ablation == false'
    splitBy: [deployment, speed, dataset, kind, task]
    value: { property: rms_mm }
    pivot:
      rows: [family, model, config]
      roles: { deployment: deployment, speed: group, dataset: dataset }
      rollup: median
      metrics: [rms_mm, full_mm, max_mm, stop_mm, gates]
      reference: ablation
    bars: { x: config, color: family, column: "@ur5e_alone · dev / ×1.0 / workspace/v2 / Joint A→B", orient: horizontal, order: value, scale: linear, mark: dot, interval: true, normalize: none }
  - type: bars
    name: Violin · tasks
    filters: 'ablation == false'
    splitBy: [deployment, speed, dataset, kind, task]
    value: { property: rms_mm }
    pivot:
      rows: [family, model, config]
      roles: { deployment: deployment, speed: group, dataset: dataset }
      rollup: median
      metrics: [rms_mm, full_mm, max_mm, stop_mm, gates]
      reference: ablation
    bars: { x: model, color: family, column: "@ur5e_alone · dev / ×1.0 / workspace/v2", orient: vertical, order: value, scale: linear, mark: violin, interval: false, normalize: none }
  - type: bars
    name: Normalised · × p1
    filters: 'ablation == false && deployment == "ur5e_alone · dev"'
    splitBy: [deployment, speed, dataset, kind, task]
    value: { property: rms_mm }
    pivot:
      rows: [family, model, config]
      roles: { deployment: deployment, speed: group, dataset: dataset }
      rollup: median
      metrics: [rms_mm, full_mm, max_mm, stop_mm, gates]
      reference: ablation
    bars: { x: kind, color: model, orient: vertical, order: name, scale: log, mark: bar, interval: false, normalize: { against: "P1 · no feed-forward, board PD › p1", as: ratio } }
